OL,3,GNEWSACouple feel 'like prisoners' after
OL,4,Abus service loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have said they feel like
OL,7,F"prisoners in their own home" following
OL,8,Fthe closure of a bus company in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FCommunity Transport for Nottingham
OL,12,F(CT4N) announced it would cease trading
OL,13,Fwith immediate effect on Friday due to
OL,14,Frising costs.
OL,16,FSharon Murray and her wife Valerie
OL,17,FDuncan, from Bleasby, relied on the 300
OL,18,Fservice operated by the firm to travel
OL,19,Fto nearby towns for shopping and
OL,20,Fmedical appointments.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
